Description: Generic storage enclosure tool and Prometheus exporter
 Go port of Gandi/jbod-rs for Linux SCSI enclosure monitoring.
 .
 Ships the jbod command line tool and prometheus-jbod-exporter, which
 exposes enclosure temperatures and fan speeds in Prometheus text format.
 .
 The tools read /sys/class/enclosure and call lsscsi and the sg3-utils
 (sg_inq, sg_map, sg_ses, sginfo, scsi_temperature); the enclosure kernel
 module has to be loaded and the HBA must not hide the shelf behind a RAID
 firmware.
